From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:44:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] CandyOS P28: restyle the GrantPermissions dialog to Holo dark

KitKat UI Project 14.4: the runtime permission dialog's GrantPermissions
theme parented the hardcoded Material Light alert dialog; parent it to
Theme.DeviceDefault.Dialog.Alert instead, which after the frameworks/base
Holo rebase renders the 4.4 dark chrome (KitKat-style grant dialog)
while keeping every behavioral item (the buttons, and the window
attributes below, are untouched). Chrome-only - runtime permission
behavior is unchanged.

Live-tree edit from the P14 era, previously uncaptured: this project was
not a patched project, so every candyos-sync silently reverted it
(TASKS 31.2).

Change-Id: Ica5318b54b58b3b02d8d230f3b5d272e376fe715
---
 PermissionController/res/values/themes.xml | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/PermissionController/res/values/themes.xml b/PermissionController/res/values/themes.xml
index 4f59ec29d..da6344ca7 100644
--- a/PermissionController/res/values/themes.xml
+++ b/PermissionController/res/values/themes.xml
@@ -48,8 +48,14 @@
         <item name="preferenceTheme">@style/PreferenceThemeOverlay</item>
     </style>
 
+    <!-- KitKat UI Project (14.4): runtime permission dialogs restyled to
+         Holo dark (parent was the hardcoded Light alert dialog; the
+         framework DeviceDefault dark alert now renders 4.4 chrome).
+         Runtime permission behavior is unchanged - chrome only. NOTE:
+         this lives in the mainline PermissionController module; re-apply
+         after syncing that project. -->
     <style name="GrantPermissions"
-           parent="@android:style/Theme.DeviceDefault.Light.Dialog.Alert">
+           parent="@android:style/Theme.DeviceDefault.Dialog.Alert">
         <item name="android:windowNoTitle">true</item>
         <item name="android:windowBackground">@android:color/transparent</item>
         <!-- The following attributes change the behavior of the dialog, hence they should not be
-- 
2.53.0

